Bundle-Name: Model Atlas Action API — stage lifecycle SPI
Bundle-Description: The whiteboard contract (StageActionService, ActionContext) an \
 implementation registers to be called when an object enters, is updated in, or leaves \
 a stage. Deliberately free of EMF and of the rest of the workflow bundle, so an \
 implementor outside this repository — or a bundle here that only reacts to stage \
 events — does not inherit the platform to provide one.

-workingset: workflow

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.util.promise;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.annotation.versioning;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.annotation.bundle;version=latest
